{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-tracing","title":"分布式追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/observability/distributed-tracing","wordCount":1524,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"分布式追踪\">分布式追踪</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要分布式追踪\">为什么需要分布式追踪</h2><p>在单体应用中，一个请求的完整执行路径可以通过本地堆栈和日志轻松追踪。但在微服务架构下，一个用户请求可能经过数十个服务的协作处理，跨越多个进程、容器甚至数据中心。当出现延迟异常或错误时，仅靠单个服务的日志和指标无法定位问题发生在哪个环节。</p>\n<p>分布式追踪通过为每个请求分配全局唯一的 Trace ID，并在服务间传播上下文信息，将一个请求的完整调用链路串联起来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[客户端] --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| B[API 网关]&#10;    B --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| C[用户服务]&#10;    B --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| D[订单服务]&#10;    D --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| E[支付服务]&#10;    D --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| F[库存服务]&#10;    E --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| G[风控服务]\">graph LR\n    A[客户端] --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| B[API 网关]\n    B --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| C[用户服务]\n    B --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| D[订单服务]\n    D --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| E[支付服务]\n    D --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| F[库存服务]\n    E --&gt;|trace_id: abc123| G[风控服务]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"trace-span-和-context\">Trace、Span 和 Context</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Trace</td>\n<td>一个请求的完整调用链路</td>\n<td>整个故事</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Span</td>\n<td>Trace 中的一个操作单元</td>\n<td>故事中的一个章节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Parent Span</td>\n<td>发起调用的 Span</td>\n<td>上一章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child Span</td>\n<td>被调用产生的 Span</td>\n<td>下一章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Span Context</td>\n<td>在服务间传播的上下文信息</td>\n<td>故事的线索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Baggage</td>\n<td>随 Context 传播的自定义键值对</td>\n<td>故事的伏笔</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"span-的生命周期\">Span 的生命周期</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as 订单服务&#10;    participant B as 支付服务&#10;    participant C as 通知服务&#10;&#10;    Note over A: Span A 开始&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;B: HTTP POST /pay (传播 trace context)&#10;    Note over B: Span B 开始&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: 处理支付逻辑&#10;    Note over B: Span B 结束 (200ms)&#10;    B--&gt;&gt;A: 支付成功&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: gRPC Notify (传播 trace context)&#10;    Note over C: Span C 开始&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;C: 发送通知&#10;    Note over C: Span C 结束 (50ms)&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;A: 通知已发送&#10;    Note over A: Span A 结束 (350ms)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as 订单服务\n    participant B as 支付服务\n    participant C as 通知服务\n\n    Note over A: Span A 开始\n    A-&gt;&gt;B: HTTP POST /pay (传播 trace context)\n    Note over B: Span B 开始\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: 处理支付逻辑\n    Note over B: Span B 结束 (200ms)\n    B--&gt;&gt;A: 支付成功\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: gRPC Notify (传播 trace context)\n    Note over C: Span C 开始\n    C-&gt;&gt;C: 发送通知\n    Note over C: Span C 结束 (50ms)\n    C--&gt;&gt;A: 通知已发送\n    Note over A: Span A 结束 (350ms)</pre><h3 id=\"span-的关键属性\">Span 的关键属性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>trace_id</td>\n<td>全局唯一的追踪标识</td>\n<td><code>4bf92f3577b34da6a3ce929d0e0e4736</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>span_id</td>\n<td>当前 Span 的唯一标识</td>\n<td><code>00f067aa0ba902b7</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>parent_span_id</td>\n<td>父 Span 的标识</td>\n<td><code>0000000000000000</code>（根 Span）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>operation_name</td>\n<td>操作名称</td>\n<td><code>POST /api/orders</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>start_time</td>\n<td>开始时间</td>\n<td><code>2024-03-15T10:23:45.123Z</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>duration</td>\n<td>持续时间</td>\n<td><code>350ms</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>status</td>\n<td>状态码</td>\n<td><code>OK</code>、<code>ERROR</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>attributes</td>\n<td>自定义属性</td>\n<td><code>http.method=POST</code>、<code>http.status_code=200</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>events</td>\n<td>Span 内的事件记录</td>\n<td>异常信息、日志条目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"opentelemetry\">OpenTelemetry</h2><h3 id=\"什么是-opentelemetry\">什么是 OpenTelemetry</h3><p>OpenTelemetry（简称 OTel）是 CNCF 的可观测性标准项目，统一了分布式追踪、指标和日志的采集和传输协议。它合并了之前的 OpenTracing 和 OpenCensus 两个项目，是当前可观测性领域的事实标准。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph OpenTelemetry 架构&#10;        A[应用代码] --&gt; B[OTel SDK]&#10;        B --&gt; C[OTel Collector]&#10;        C --&gt; D[Jaeger]&#10;        C --&gt; E[Zipkin]&#10;        C --&gt; F[Grafana Tempo]&#10;        C --&gt; G[商业 APM]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph OpenTelemetry 架构\n        A[应用代码] --&gt; B[OTel SDK]\n        B --&gt; C[OTel Collector]\n        C --&gt; D[Jaeger]\n        C --&gt; E[Zipkin]\n        C --&gt; F[Grafana Tempo]\n        C --&gt; G[商业 APM]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"otel-的核心组件\">OTel 的核心组件</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>API</td>\n<td>可观测性数据的接口定义</td>\n<td>定义 Tracer、Meter、Logger 等接口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDK</td>\n<td>API 的标准实现</td>\n<td>实现数据采集、处理和导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Collector</td>\n<td>独立的数据收集代理</td>\n<td>接收、处理和导出遥测数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Instrumentation</td>\n<td>自动/手动埋点库</td>\n<td>自动为常用框架注入追踪代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OTLP</td>\n<td>数据传输协议</td>\n<td>统一的遥测数据传输格式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"otel-collector-架构\">OTel Collector 架构</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph OTel Collector&#10;        A[Receivers] --&gt; B[Processors]&#10;        B --&gt; C[Exporters]&#10;    end&#10;    D[应用 OTLP] --&gt; A&#10;    E[Prometheus /metrics] --&gt; A&#10;    F[Jaeger Agent] --&gt; A&#10;    C --&gt; G[Jaeger Backend]&#10;    C --&gt; H[Prometheus Remote Write]&#10;    C --&gt; I[Loki]\">graph LR\n    subgraph OTel Collector\n        A[Receivers] --&gt; B[Processors]\n        B --&gt; C[Exporters]\n    end\n    D[应用 OTLP] --&gt; A\n    E[Prometheus /metrics] --&gt; A\n    F[Jaeger Agent] --&gt; A\n    C --&gt; G[Jaeger Backend]\n    C --&gt; H[Prometheus Remote Write]\n    C --&gt; I[Loki]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>常用实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Receivers</td>\n<td>接收遥测数据</td>\n<td>otlp、prometheus、jaeger</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Processors</td>\n<td>处理和转换数据</td>\n<td>batch、filter、attributes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Exporters</td>\n<td>导出数据到后端</td>\n<td>otlp、jaeger、prometheus</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"collector-配置示例\">Collector 配置示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"receivers:&#10;  otlp:&#10;    protocols:&#10;      grpc:&#10;        endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4317&#10;      http:&#10;        endpoint: 0.0.0.0:4318&#10;&#10;processors:&#10;  batch:&#10;    timeout: 5s&#10;    send_batch_size: 1024&#10;  filter:&#10;    spans:&#10;      exclude:&#10;        match_type: strict&#10;        attributes:&#10;          - key: http.target&#10;            value: /healthz&#10;&#10;exporters:&#10;  jaeger:&#10;    endpoint: jaeger-collector:14250&#10;    tls:&#10;      insecure: true&#10;  prometheus:&#10;    endpoint: 0.0.0.0:8889&#10;&#10;service:&#10;  pipelines:&#10;    traces:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [batch, filter]&#10;      exporters: [jaeger]&#10;    metrics:&#10;      receivers: [otlp]&#10;      processors: [batch]&#10;      exporters: [prometheus]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    protocols</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      grpc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:4317</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:4318</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    send_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spans</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exclude</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        match_type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">strict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        attributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">http.target</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/healthz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  jaeger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">jaeger-collector:14250</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      insecure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">0.0.0.0:8889</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    traces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">jaeger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    metrics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prometheus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"追踪后端对比\">追踪后端对比</h2><h3 id=\"jaeger-vs-zipkin-vs-tempo\">Jaeger vs Zipkin vs Tempo</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Jaeger</th>\n<th>Zipkin</th>\n<th>Grafana Tempo</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发者</td>\n<td>Uber → CNCF</td>\n<td>Twitter</td>\n<td>Grafana Labs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储后端</td>\n<td>Cassandra、Elasticsearch、Kafka</td>\n<td>MySQL、Cassandra、Elasticsearch</td>\n<td>对象存储（S3、GCS）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询能力</td>\n<td>按 Trace ID、服务名、标签查询</td>\n<td>类似 Jaeger</td>\n<td>仅按 Trace ID 查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储成本</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（对象存储）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与 Grafana 集成</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>原生集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应采样</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持（依赖前端采样）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务依赖图</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>内置</td>\n<td>通过 Grafana 生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"选型建议\">选型建议</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[选择追踪后端] --&gt; B{已有 Grafana 生态?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{需要复杂查询?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{需要自适应采样?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[Jaeger + Grafana]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| F[Grafana Tempo]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| G[Jaeger]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| H{成本敏感?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[Grafana Tempo]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[Jaeger]\">flowchart TD\n    A[选择追踪后端] --&gt; B{已有 Grafana 生态?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C{需要复杂查询?}\n    B --&gt;|否| D{需要自适应采样?}\n    C --&gt;|是| E[Jaeger + Grafana]\n    C --&gt;|否| F[Grafana Tempo]\n    D --&gt;|是| G[Jaeger]\n    D --&gt;|否| H{成本敏感?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[Grafana Tempo]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[Jaeger]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"采样策略\">采样策略</h2><p>全量采集所有请求的追踪数据在高流量系统中不可行。采样策略决定了哪些请求的追踪数据会被保留。</p>\n<h3 id=\"采样类型\">采样类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>头部采样</td>\n<td>请求入口时决定是否采样</td>\n<td>实现简单、低开销</td>\n<td>可能遗漏异常请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部采样</td>\n<td>请求完成后根据结果决定</td>\n<td>保证异常请求被采集</td>\n<td>需要缓存完整 Trace、实现复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应采样</td>\n<td>根据流量和错误率动态调整</td>\n<td>兼顾效率和覆盖率</td>\n<td>需要后端支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"采样策略配置\">采样策略配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"processors:&#10;  tail_sampling:&#10;    decision_wait: 10s&#10;    num_traces: 100000&#10;    policies:&#10;      - name: errors-policy&#10;        type: status_code&#10;        status_code: { status_codes: [ERROR] }&#10;      - name: slow-traces&#10;        type: latency&#10;        latency: { threshold_ms: 1000 }&#10;      - name: probabilistic-policy&#10;        type: probabilistic&#10;        probabilistic: { sampling_percentage: 10 }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tail_sampling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    decision_wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    num_traces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">errors-policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">status_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        status_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">status_codes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ERROR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slow-traces</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">latency</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        latency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">threshold_ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">probabilistic-policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">probabilistic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        probabilistic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sampling_percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span></code></pre></div><p>上述配置的含义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有错误请求 100% 采集</li>\n<li>延迟超过 1 秒的请求 100% 采集</li>\n<li>其余请求按 10% 比率采样</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"链路分析实战\">链路分析实战</h2><h3 id=\"瀑布图分析\">瀑布图分析</h3><p>瀑布图（Waterfall View）是分析 Trace 最常用的视图。它以时间轴为横轴，以服务调用层级为纵轴，直观展示每个 Span 的耗时和层级关系：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Trace: abc123 (总耗时 850ms)&#10;├── API Gateway (50ms)&#10;│   ├── Auth Service (20ms)&#10;│   └── Order Service (780ms)&#10;│       ├── Inventory Check (100ms)&#10;│       ├── Price Calculation (30ms)&#10;│       └── Payment Service (600ms)  ← 瓶颈&#10;│           ├── Risk Check (50ms)&#10;│           └── Bank API Call (520ms) ← 根因&#10;└── Response Serialization (20ms)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Trace: abc123 (总耗时 850ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── API Gateway (50ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Auth Service (20ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── Order Service (780ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── Inventory Check (100ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── Price Calculation (30ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── Payment Service (600ms)  ← 瓶颈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           ├── Risk Check (50ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│           └── Bank API Call (520ms) ← 根因</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Response Serialization (20ms)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常见链路问题模式\">常见链路问题模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>可能原因</th>\n<th>排查方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单点瓶颈</td>\n<td>某个 Span 耗时占比极高</td>\n<td>慢查询、外部 API 延迟</td>\n<td>检查该 Span 的详细属性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>串行调用</td>\n<td>可并行的调用被串行执行</td>\n<td>代码逻辑问题</td>\n<td>重构为并行调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>N+1 调用</td>\n<td>大量重复的同类 Span</td>\n<td>循环中调用外部服务</td>\n<td>批量化请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试风暴</td>\n<td>同一操作产生大量重试 Span</td>\n<td>下游超时、重试策略不当</td>\n<td>优化重试和断路器配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长尾延迟</td>\n<td>P99 远高于 P50</td>\n<td>GC 停顿、资源竞争</td>\n<td>检查 JVM/Runtime 指标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"服务依赖拓扑\">服务依赖拓扑</h3><p>追踪数据可以自动生成服务间的依赖关系图：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[API Gateway] --&gt; B[User Service]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Order Service]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Inventory Service]&#10;    C --&gt; E[Payment Service]&#10;    E --&gt; F[Risk Service]&#10;    E --&gt; G[Bank Gateway]&#10;    C --&gt; H[Notification Service]&#10;    B --&gt; I[Cache Redis]&#10;    C --&gt; J[DB PostgreSQL]&#10;    D --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[API Gateway] --&gt; B[User Service]\n    A --&gt; C[Order Service]\n    C --&gt; D[Inventory Service]\n    C --&gt; E[Payment Service]\n    E --&gt; F[Risk Service]\n    E --&gt; G[Bank Gateway]\n    C --&gt; H[Notification Service]\n    B --&gt; I[Cache Redis]\n    C --&gt; J[DB PostgreSQL]\n    D --&gt; J</pre><p>这张拓扑图可以帮助团队回答以下问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>哪些服务是关键路径上的？</li>\n<li>哪些服务之间存在循环依赖？</li>\n<li>新增的依赖关系是否符合预期？</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"追踪与日志-指标的关联\">追踪与日志、指标的关联</h2><h3 id=\"exemplar-指标到追踪的桥梁\">Exemplar：指标到追踪的桥梁</h3><p>Exemplar 是 Prometheus 2.26+ 引入的特性，允许在指标数据点上附加 Trace ID，实现从指标异常点直接跳转到对应的追踪数据：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Grafana 指标图表] --&gt;|点击异常数据点| B[Exemplar: trace_id=abc123]&#10;    B --&gt;|跳转| C[Jaeger/Tempo 追踪详情]&#10;    C --&gt;|trace_id 关联| D[Loki 日志]\">graph LR\n    A[Grafana 指标图表] --&gt;|点击异常数据点| B[Exemplar: trace_id=abc123]\n    B --&gt;|跳转| C[Jaeger/Tempo 追踪详情]\n    C --&gt;|trace_id 关联| D[Loki 日志]</pre><p>这种关联能力让排障流程从&quot;指标发现异常 → 手动搜索日志&quot;变为&quot;指标发现异常 → 一键跳转到追踪 → 一键查看关联日志&quot;，排障效率可提升数倍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"统一可观测性平台\">统一可观测性平台</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 数据采集层&#10;        A[OTel SDK] --&gt; B[OTel Collector]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 存储层&#10;        B --&gt; C[Prometheus 指标]&#10;        B --&gt; D[Loki 日志]&#10;        B --&gt; E[Tempo 追踪]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 查询层&#10;        F[Grafana] --&gt; C&#10;        F --&gt; D&#10;        F --&gt; E&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 数据采集层\n        A[OTel SDK] --&gt; B[OTel Collector]\n    end\n    subgraph 存储层\n        B --&gt; C[Prometheus 指标]\n        B --&gt; D[Loki 日志]\n        B --&gt; E[Tempo 追踪]\n    end\n    subgraph 查询层\n        F[Grafana] --&gt; C\n        F --&gt; D\n        F --&gt; E\n    end</pre><p>Grafana 生态的 Prometheus + Loki + Tempo 组合是目前最流行的统一可观测性平台方案。三者共享 Grafana 作为查询和可视化前端，通过 Trace ID 实现跨数据源的无缝跳转。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分布式追踪是微服务架构中不可或缺的可观测性能力。OpenTelemetry 已经成为采集标准，选择 Jaeger 或 Tempo 作为后端取决于团队的查询需求和成本偏好。合理的采样策略是平衡数据完整性和系统开销的关键。追踪数据的最大价值不仅在于单次排障，更在于通过链路分析持续发现架构中的性能瓶颈和设计缺陷。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分布式追踪","id":"分布式追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要分布式追踪","id":"为什么需要分布式追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"Trace、Span 和 Context","id":"trace-span-和-context"},{"level":3,"text":"Span 的生命周期","id":"span-的生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"Span 的关键属性","id":"span-的关键属性"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenTelemetry","id":"opentelemetry"},{"level":3,"text":"什么是 OpenTelemetry","id":"什么是-opentelemetry"},{"level":3,"text":"OTel 的核心组件","id":"otel-的核心组件"},{"level":3,"text":"OTel Collector 架构","id":"otel-collector-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"Collector 配置示例","id":"collector-配置示例"},{"level":2,"text":"追踪后端对比","id":"追踪后端对比"},{"level":3,"text":"Jaeger vs Zipkin vs Tempo","id":"jaeger-vs-zipkin-vs-tempo"},{"level":3,"text":"选型建议","id":"选型建议"},{"level":2,"text":"采样策略","id":"采样策略"},{"level":3,"text":"采样类型","id":"采样类型"},{"level":3,"text":"采样策略配置","id":"采样策略配置"},{"level":2,"text":"链路分析实战","id":"链路分析实战"},{"level":3,"text":"瀑布图分析","id":"瀑布图分析"},{"level":3,"text":"常见链路问题模式","id":"常见链路问题模式"},{"level":3,"text":"服务依赖拓扑","id":"服务依赖拓扑"},{"level":2,"text":"追踪与日志、指标的关联","id":"追踪与日志-指标的关联"},{"level":3,"text":"Exemplar：指标到追踪的桥梁","id":"exemplar-指标到追踪的桥梁"},{"level":3,"text":"统一可观测性平台","id":"统一可观测性平台"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"指标与监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/observability/metrics-and-monitoring"},"next":{"title":"告警策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/observability/alerting-strategy"}}